<section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="s1-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="story" data-lit>
      <h2 class="story__title rv" id="s1-title">Enterprise Cybersecurity Built Around Business Risk</h2>

      <div class="story__aside" aria-hidden="true">
        {{ icon("buildings", "lg") }}
        <span class="story__rail"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="story__body">
        <p>CipherTrivia helps enterprises address complex cyber risks through managed cyber security solutions that focus on identifying vulnerabilities and strengthening defenses across critical IT environments. From cloud infrastructure and enterprise applications to corporate networks and sensitive business data, we assess security gaps that could expose organizations to cyber attacks or operational disruption.</p>
        <p>Our cyber security for enterprises approach combines penetration testing and vulnerability assessments with application security reviews and infrastructure risk analysis. Each engagement delivers prioritized findings and practical remediation recommendations, helping security teams address critical weaknesses and make informed decisions about risk reduction.</p>
        <p>By aligning security assessments with enterprise infrastructure and business priorities, CipherTrivia helps organizations strengthen their security posture and safeguard essential digital assets as their technology environments evolve.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

