<!-- COMPLIANCE: framework tiles + how CipherTrivia supports compliance   -->
<!-- ================================================================== -->
<section class="section section--stone" aria-labelledby="s5-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="ihead">
      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s5-title">Enterprise Cyber Security Compliance Frameworks We Support</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">At CipherTrivia, we help enterprises assess security controls against recognized cybersecurity standards and regulatory requirements. Our enterprise cyber security services identify control gaps and technical vulnerabilities while providing practical recommendations to support risk management and compliance initiatives.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="fw-grid fw-grid--8">
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("badge") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">ISO 27001</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">ISO/IEC 27001</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Assess information security controls and risk management practices to identify weaknesses in areas such as access management and data handling or infrastructure security.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("shield-check") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">SOC 2</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">SOC 2</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Review security controls relevant to SOC 2 Trust Services Criteria, helping organizations identify gaps in access controls and system monitoring or data confidentiality practices.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("radar") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">NIST CSF</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">NIST Cybersecurity Framework (CSF)</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Evaluate cybersecurity practices across governance and identification alongside protection, detection, response and recovery to highlight opportunities for security improvement.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("sliders") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">CIS</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">CIS Critical Security Controls</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Assess system configurations and security practices against CIS recommendations to identify weaknesses in asset management and access control or vulnerability management.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("user-shield") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">GDPR</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">GDPR</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Review technical and organizational security measures related to personal data processing, helping organizations identify security gaps that may affect data confidentiality and regulatory obligations.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("card") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">PCI DSS</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">PCI DSS</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Assess payment environments and related systems for technical security weaknesses in areas such as network security and access control or vulnerability management.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("health-record") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">HIPAA</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">HIPAA</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Support healthcare organizations in assessing technical safeguards and access controls relevant to protecting electronic protected health information (ePHI).</p>
      </article>
      <article class="fw rv" style="--d:3">
        <div class="fw__top">{{ icon("eye-off") }}<span class="fw__mark" aria-hidden="true">ISO 27701</span></div>
        <h3 class="fw__title">ISO/IEC 27701</h3>
        <p class="fw__text">Review privacy information management practices and related controls to identify gaps in personal data governance and privacy risk management.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="fw-note rv">
      {{ icon("doc-check", "sm") }}
      <div>
        <h3 class="fw-note__title">How CipherTrivia Supports Compliance</h3>
        <p>Our assessments help enterprises identify vulnerabilities and document control gaps while prioritizing remediation activities against relevant framework requirements. Findings can support internal audits and compliance preparation; formal certification or independent attestation must be conducted by the appropriate authorized or qualified body.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

